# This machine has core.autocrlf=true set system-wide. Without the rules below,
# Git would apply line-ending translation to .mcw save files and silently corrupt
# them — any 0x0A byte in packed block data or compressed payload could be rewritten
# as 0x0D 0x0A on checkout. That would break the golden-save regression tests in a way
# that looks like a loader bug rather than a Git configuration problem.
#
# Marking them binary disables both translation and diffing.
*.mcw   binary
*.bin   binary
*.png   binary
*.ogg   binary

# Source and docs: normalize to LF in the repository, checked out natively.
*.js     text eol=lf
*.html   text eol=lf
*.css    text eol=lf
*.json   text eol=lf
*.md     text eol=lf
*.py     text eol=lf
*.glsl   text eol=lf

# Windows launcher must keep CRLF or cmd.exe can mis-parse it.
*.bat    text eol=crlf
